I hear ticking sounds.

119
00:17:20,048 --> 00:17:22,348
見えてる？じゃあ始めますのじゃ。
Can you see it? Then I'll start.

120
00:17:24,088 --> 00:17:25,788
もう時間か…。
Is it time already...?

121
