あれ？ 今音鳴ってたよね？
Huh? It just made a sound, right?

500
00:41:32,794 --> 00:41:34,594
消えたご飯 えっ もう食べちゃったの？
The rice disappeared. Huh? Did you already eat it?

501
00:41:36,074 --> 00:41:37,074
え、消えたご飯
Huh, the rice disappeared.

502
00:41:39,204 --> 00:41:40,314
消えたご飯
The rice disappeared.

503
