え、なに うーん これコンビニの裏のあれじゃん 監視カメラで見てたとこなのじゃ
Eh, what? Uun... This is that place behind the convenience store, right? The place we saw on the security cameras!

513
00:42:32,174 --> 00:42:32,794
なに？
What?

514
00:42:35,294 --> 00:42:35,954
なに？
What?

515
